" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blink_(Condition)\" title=\"Blink (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blink\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blink_(Condition)\" title=\"Blink (Condition)\">Blink</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Blink\"> Condition: Blink </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blink_(Condition)\" title=\"Blink (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blink\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blink_(Condition)\" title=\"Blink (Condition)\">Blink</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>At the end of each turn, there is a chance the affected entity gets <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\">Blinked to the Ethereal Plane</a>, where it can't be harmed, seen or affected.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>While in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ethereal_Plane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ethereal_Plane\">Ethereal Plane</a></span>, the entity can't move or interact with anything in the world. It can only choose to teleport up to 6 m (20 ft). When combat ends, so does this effect.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by traders, found in containers, and carried by enemies</li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714224340\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2332/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38535/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7490/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1216934/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.702      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   62.702      1 -total\n 40.68%   25.505      9 Template:Icon_text\n 36.52%   22.896     25 Template:Trim\n 17.59%   11.032      3 Template:Uid\n 14.52%    9.107      1 Template:Condition\n 10.62%    6.660      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.46%    6.560      3 Template:Icon_link\n 10.31%    6.466      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.82%    6.160      1 Template:Main_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:16423-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714224340 and revision id 379005. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}